 CD8&#x0002b; T cell determinants to enable rational design and characterization of smallpox vaccines.</article-title><source>J Exp Med</source><volume>201</volume><fpage>95</fpage><lpage>104</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15623576</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004089-Wolint1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wolint</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Betts</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Koup</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Oxenius</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Immediate cytotoxicity but not degranulation distinguishes effector and memory subsets of CD8&#x0002b; T cells.</article-title><source>J Exp Med</source><volume>199</volume><fpage>925</fpage><lpage>936</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15051762</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004089-Blattman1"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Blattman</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Antia</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Sourdive</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaech</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Estimating the precursor frequency of naive antigen-specific CD8 T cells.</article-title><source>J Exp Med</source><volume>195</volume><fpage>657</fpage><lpage>664</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11877489</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004089-Weninger1"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weninger</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Manjunath</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>von Andrian</su